      "description": "✨SG Good Selection✨\n\nSingapore Local Stock, Fast Shipping\n\n\n\nFeatures:\n\n[Material]: Carbon Steel+ PP\n\n[Color]: White/Black\n\n[Weight capacity]: 160lbs\n\n\n\nDimension: \n\nNot Extendable- 58 x 36 x 43 (W x D x H)\n\nRetractable- 64 x 36 x 43cm (W x D x H), Width(40-64cm)adjustable\n\nPackage included: Microwave oven shelf x 1pc, hook x 6pcs, cutting board rack x 1\n\nLoad Bearing: Approx. 25kg/55.12lb\n\n\n\n🔔【Kitchen Space Saving Helper】\n\nSay goodbye to the chaos kitchen area! With the help of over microwave shelf, you can tidy your kitchen tools up on the shelf and save a lot of space for cooking, make your kitchen clean and neat.\n\n🔔【Large Capacity Storage Shelf】\n\nWith raised guardrails on both sides, You can securely put a lot of items on it such as microwave, toaster, tableware, bottles, spices, condiments, canned foods, dishes, pots, pans or any other kitchen gears.\n\n🔔【Expandable Design】\n\nThe microwave rack can be extended left and right, the length of the microwave shelf can be adjusted between 40-64cm, just by twisting the back of rod.\n\n🔔【Easy to Install and Clean】\n\nOur metal microwave shelf comes with the tools and the instruction, installation can be finished very soon.\n\n\nNote:\n\n- There might be 1-2 cm deviation due to manual measurement.\n\n- There might be slight colour deviation due to limitations in photography and the inevitable differences in monitor settings.",
